  {"data":{"source":"household-income-conditions","target":"household-consumption","type":"AFFECTS","relation":"leading_factor","lag":"1—2 个季度","explanation":"居民收入状况决定后续消费可支配的资源，而储蓄行为和预期会改变传导时点。","applicability":["居民收入变化能够影响可支配资源和消费计划时"],"limitations":["储蓄倾向、债务负担和收入预期会改变消费响应","收入统计与消费支出存在覆盖和时间差异"],"evidence":[{"title":"国家统计局：居民收入和消费支出情况","url":"https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfb/202601/t20260119_1962321.html"}]}},
  {"data":{"source":"disposable-income","target":"household-income-conditions","type":"REFLECTS"}},
  {"data":{"source":"disposable-income","target":"household-consumption","type":"AFFECTS"}},
